{"version":1,"key":"card:231","content":{"id":231,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"568a7b9f-3fc0-44d1-83e1-099a8594f485","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们调用函数时，传入的参数个数可以与定义函数时要求的函数个数不同，可多可少。所以传入的参数都会保存在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中，无论是在函数签名中已经定义了的参数(命名参数)还是未定义的参数(匿名参数)"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9e69c26a-32ec-43d4-8612-e38200d7fc52","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c65925b1-3cb0-461b-bb1b-68f4d891d3c7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function print(arg) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < arguments.length; i++) {\n    console.log(arguments[i]);\n  }\n}\n\nprint(\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"); // a\n                      // b\n                      // c","collabId":"74c1b968-412a-4543-beb4-020fcbbc1b24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b97b2a20-3388-49f4-a119-06200f18c8dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中引入了剩余参数(Rest Parameters)，剩余参数中只保留匿名参数的值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"411dfd3e-f1c8-44f2-99ca-4dfab45c2014","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5a9dc0fc-9ef0-435a-9357-1a43baa4c77e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function print(arg, ...values) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n    console.log(values[i]);\n  }\n}\n\nprint(\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"); // b\n                      // c","collabId":"0efe820c-b198-40d1-be30-3791f3aa1657","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"26874cce-319b-4949-a285-037a63698718","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面对函数进行了一点修改，在参数列表中添加了一项 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"...values"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"values"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示的就是剩余参数，如果调用函数时多传入了参数，那么多余的参数就会放入 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"values"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个数组中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2995b0a4-40dc-4ac5-a403-c58eca1387ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数的不同："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"23e8c6ab-6b85-47a7-ab13-d35d51b55fb9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e55ba25c-f41e-4d6a-b15b-83e8e7ab0a2d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7aec95cc-f370-420b-a520-250ff10dd808","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数是一个真正的数组，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个类数组"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"58cbf761-4139-45a5-9bc8-644ea9993d5b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9553f90-281c-4030-b40d-3c9b5d309822","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数中只保存了匿名参数的值，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 则保存了所有传入的值"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49f655e4-c782-4bee-b268-d50d9e993de1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用剩余参数有两点限制："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"c910b162-2cf3-4b2f-aa61-1fcadff370f9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e8e415b1-aa70-4a48-b63f-35029b51c8c5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dbb30960-6e9f-41ab-8669-cc9c9a0c2dbb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个函数中只能有一个剩余参数，且剩余参数必须放置在参数列表的最后"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9c2b5cfc-b92e-4a18-a1ef-64945769e92b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfdcb471-50d2-48e5-b97b-6dcd63484bc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数不能用于对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法中"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d5062382-8adb-4a15-b604-2a8787a597ac","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2aedf301-be39-45d4-acc2-1bbbbc12ee81","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let obj = {\n  // SyntaxError: Setter function argument must not be a rest parameter\n  set name(...values) {\n    // do something\n  }\n}","collabId":"0748e421-90de-47e6-9230-3a8b326a06e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"deb8a40e-f00c-4fd2-8879-d02c61159f87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法被限制为只能有一个参数，但是剩余参数理论上表示的是可以接受无穷多的参数。"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"a3505ccd-8618-4fdd-8a44-6bd678581960","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c7219a2-d9b6-4a91-813c-9cbe0d3d8a10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无论在函数的参数列表中是否定义了剩余参数，都对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象没有影响，它始终保存着传入函数的所有参数。"}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690901109259,"updateTime":1743303640411,"linkedCards":[{"id":229,"target":{"key":"card:229","type":"card","id":229},"summary":"每一个函数中都会有一个 arguments 对象，其中保存的是传入的参数值。 arguments 对象在严格和非严格模式下的行为是不同的。 在非严格模式下， arguments 会受到命名参数的影响，即在函数内对命名参数进行修改，也会相应的...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":232,"target":{"key":"card:232","type":"card","id":232},"summary":"Function 构造函数一般是用来生成函数实例的，但是我们很少用到它来声明一个函数 let add = new Function(\"first\", \"second\", \"return first + second\"); console.l...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640411}}